SUMMARY:Fun on the common (is back!)
DESCRIPTION:Leader: Martin Thomas\n\nThis is an efforts session … and is 
 suitable for all abilities.\nWhatever your pace is … that’s ok. \n\nWe 
 will start with a warm up routine followed by a series of ‘low hill repea
 ts’. \nThen some cool down stretches. \n\nThe session uses short loops wi
 th an incline. Efforts will be up the hill with flat and down being recover
 y. \n\nFor those that have done this with me before it is on the figure of 
 eight segment. \n\nGenuinely suits all abilities. \n\nFor those wanting to 
 try efforts for the first time or those coming back from injury (me include
 d!) there is the option to sit out for a loop(s). \n\nFaster/stronger runne
 rs will be able to do more loops in the time. \n\nIt’s fun … honest �
 �\n\nMartin \n[Phone Number Redacted]\n\n\nView on Strava: https://www.stra
 va.com/clubs/208705/group_events/3477082677404053220\n\nSynced from Strava 
 Club 208705 on Sun\, 12 Apr @ 4:50 PM
