  for the first time or those coming back from injury (me included!) there i
 s the option to sit out for a loop(s). Faster/stronger runners will be able
  to do more loops in the time. It’s fun … honest 😁Martin [Phone Numb
 er Redacted]View on Strava: https://www.strava.com/clubs/208705/group_event
 s/3477082677404053220Synced from Strava Club 208705 on: Sun\, 12 Apr @ 4:50
